{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#card-zh","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 是用于 DSH 网页端的会话与消息管理插件，通过浏览器界面和宿主端路由协同工作。它可以盘点本地保存的会话，先展示删除计划，再把会话目录移入可恢复的回收站；用户可恢复目录，或在明确确认后永久清除。它还提供消息管理：将单条消息从模型上下文中遮蔽并可撤销，或截断某条消息之后的日志并保留备份。侧边栏入口、会话菜单和管理视图提供操作入口。默认使用 DSH_HOME 下的会话目录及本机回收站，可通过配置覆盖目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147-255","lib/index.js:568-760","lib/client.js:1244-1304"]}
{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#card-en","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-deleter manages DSH sessions and messages in the web UI. It previews removal, moves session folders to a recoverable recycle bin, and supports restore or confirmed permanent deletion. Message tools shadow a message from model context or truncate later log entries with a backup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147-255","lib/index.js:398-565","lib/client.js:1244-1304"]}
