{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#feature-1","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 的功能「预览并移入回收站」：从侧边栏或会话菜单选择会话后，先查看目录、大小、日志代际及阻挡条件，再将整个会话目录移入回收站。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147-255","lib/client.js:1249-1255"]}
{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#feature-2","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 的功能「恢复或永久清理会话」：管理回收站条目，可将目录恢复到原路径；永久清理需明确确认，并从回收站移除数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:675-760","lib/trash.js:118-170"]}
{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#feature-3","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 的功能「遮蔽单条消息」：在消息管理界面选择消息后追加 tombstone，使其不进入模型上下文；该操作可以使用撤销功能恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:398-473","lib/shadow.js:96-164"]}
{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#feature-4","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 的功能「截断消息之后的日志」：选择序号后，移除其后的事件并保留备份；支持在日志未发生后续变化时恢复备份。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:474-565","lib/shadow.js:346-510"]}
{"unit_id":"ghgjkbf__dsh-session-deleter#caveat-1","repo":"ghgjkbf/dsh-session-deleter","commit":"6dc214b20fdb1eb703f0aa513d60b34e8871888c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-deleter 使用前须知：永久清理回收站条目会递归移除其目录，且接口要求 confirm: true；确认后无法通过插件恢复。见 lib/index.js:732-751、lib/trash.js:163-170。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:732-751","lib/trash.js:163-170"]}
